{
  "id": "pokemon-card-gym-promotional-card-packs",
  "name": "Pokémon Card Gym Promotional Card Packs",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "From 2014 the Pokémon Card Gym shops in Japan, the stores that host official play, handed out numbered Promotional Card Packs at their events, each for about three months: Pack 1 from February to April 2014, Pack 2 from May to July 2014, Pack 3 from October to December 2014, Pack 4 from February to April 2015, Pack 5 from May to July 2015, Pack 6 from November 2015 to January 2016 and Pack 7 from May to July 2016. Mirror holo basic Energy cards were among their cards, and the Energy of the first three packs came back in the Pokémon Center \"Crisis Battle\" pack on 31 January 2015. Pack 4 was also the participation prize of the Rayquaza Pre-Battle in April 2015.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: XY-P Promotional cards (TCG), card list",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/XY-P_Promotional_cards_(TCG)#Card_list"
      },
